Venus × Minerva uses a file-scoped mixed licensing policy.

New original theory, Canon, documentation, and knowledge: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
New original software: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
Previously distributed material retains any rights already granted under the terms applicable to that distribution.
Third-party material retains its own legal status.
Commercial permissions for copyright held by the project may be granted separately in writing.

The controlling map, canonical license links, third-party boundaries, and contribution rules are in LICENSE_POLICY.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
